  "ID": "38086",
  "post_title": "Variada fiesta intercultural de Quisqueya ONG de Onda",
  "post_date": "2013-06-16 20:58:03",
  "post_name": "variada-fiesta-intercultural-de-quisqueya-ong-de-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p>Este domingo se ha celebrado en las inmediaciones de la Parroquia de San Bartolom&eacute;, en Monteblanco, la VII fiesta intercultural de Quisqueya ONG de Onda, con actos muy variados y la presencia del alcalde, Salvador Aguilella Ramos, y parte del equipo de gobierno.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_3400.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=38051\" target=\"_blank\">Tras la jornada de este s&aacute;bado en el Raval de Sant Josep y el Parque de la Cer&aacute;mica</a>, a partir de las 13 horas de este domingo se han abierto las paradas de venta de artesan&iacute;a y comida intercultural. Despu&eacute;s de comer se ha jugado un bingo solidario para despu&eacute;s dar paso a las&nbsp;actuaciones musicales de&nbsp;Colesteruel y grupos de m&uacute;sica latina, incluido un mariachi, entre las que se han intercalado tres interpretaciones de la danza del vientre.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3322.jpg\" alt=\"img_3322\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3323.jpg\" alt=\"img_3323\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3324.jpg\" alt=\"img_3324\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3325.jpg\" alt=\"img_3325\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3326.jpg\" alt=\"img_3326\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3327.jpg\" alt=\"img_3327\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3328.jpg\" alt=\"img_3328\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3329.jpg\" alt=\"img_3329\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3330.jpg\" alt=\"img_3330\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3331.jpg\" alt=\"img_3331\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3332.jpg\" alt=\"img_3332\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3333.jpg\" alt=\"img_3333\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3334.jpg\" alt=\"img_3334\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3335.jpg\" alt=\"img_3335\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3336.jpg\" alt=\"img_3336\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3337.jpg\" alt=\"img_3337\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisqueya13/img_3338.jpg\" alt=\"img_3338\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festainterculturalquisque